    "description": "This newly listed duplex in SF's Marina District, offers a unique investment opportunity. The property is located near iconic landmarks such as the Palace of Fine Arts, Marina Green, Tunnel Top Park, GG Bridge & Chrissy Field - and a short distance to the vibrant shopping & dining options on Chestnut St. This prime location (Walk Score 96) combines the best of urban living w/ proximity to green spaces & local attractions.    The duplex features 2 spacious, 2-level units. The lower unit offers ~2,162 sf of living space, comprising of 3 bedrooms, a bonus room/4th BR & two bathrooms. Its generous layout & abundant natural light create a welcoming environment perfect for modern living. The upper unit, ~2,430 sf, boasts 5 bedrooms & 2 bathrooms. This expansive space provides ample room for larger households or future tenants seeking accommodations in one of the city's most desirable neighborhoods.   Both units showcase period details reflecting the historic charm of the Marina District while offering the comforts of contemporary living. With high ceilings, spacious rooms & potential for modern updates, this duplex appeals to both investors & owner-occupiers. The property could be an excellent income generator as a rental or a fantastic opportunity for a multi-generational family home."
